      "content": "Grapefruit juice is a known inhibitor of certain enzymes that can affect how your body processes statins like atorvastatin. To ensure the medication works as intended and to avoid potential side effects, it is best to avoid consuming grapefruit juice while on atorvastatin. You should definitely check with your pharmacist or doctor about any specific dietary interactions while you are taking this medication.",
